Root cause: `oracle_plan()` correctly returns the full hidden functional program when called on the initial composition task, but the generic collector repeatedly called it after every operation and selected element zero. Because composition `oracle_plan()` is intentionally program-based rather than state-replanning, this produced `op1, op1, op1, ...` instead of `op1, op2, submit`.

The fix snapshots the exact oracle plan once at episode start and replays it sequentially. Causal families are unchanged.
